b'/F2 9.5 Tf' 40 729.5 Td (Q.5 \(a\) Explain TCP 3-Way Handshake Connection Establishment and 4-Way Termination. [) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 716.0 Td (    10 Marks]) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 702.5 Td (Answer:) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 689.0 Td (3-Way Handshake \(Connection Setup\):) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 675.5 Td (1. Client -> Server: SYN packet with initial sequence number seq = x. \(Client enters ) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 662.0 Td (    SYN_SENT\).) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 648.5 Td (2. Server -> Client: SYN-ACK packet with seq = y, ack = x + 1. \(Server enters SYN_RCV) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 635.0 Td (    D\).) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 621.5 Td (3. Client -> Server: ACK packet with seq = x + 1, ack = y + 1. \(Both enter ESTABLISHE) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 608.0 Td (    D\).) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 594.5 Td () Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 581.0 Td (4-Way Termination \(Connection Teardown\):) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 567.5 Td (1. Client -> Server: FIN packet. \(Client enters FIN_WAIT_1\).) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 554.0 Td (2. Server -> Client: ACK packet. \(Client enters FIN_WAIT_2, Server enters CLOSE_WAIT\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 540.5 Td (    .) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 527.0 Td (3. Server -> Client: FIN packet when server finishes sending data. \(Server enters LAS) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 513.5 Td (    T_ACK\).) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 500.0 Td (4. Client -> Server: ACK packet and enters TIME_WAIT \(2MSL duration\). Both enter CLOS) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 486.5 Td (    ED.) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 473.0 Td () Tj
b'/F2 9.5 Tf' 40 459.5 Td (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
b'/F2 9.5 Tf' 40 446.0 Td (Q.5 \(b\) Write a runnable Python Socket program for a TCP Echo Server. [10 Marks]) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 432.5 Td (Answer:) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 419.0 Td (python) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 405.5 Td (import socket) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 392.0 Td () Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 378.5 Td (def run_tcp_server\(\):) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 365.0 Td (    server_socket = socket.socket\(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_STREAM\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 351.5 Td (    server_socket.bind\(\('127.0.0.1', 8080\)\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 338.0 Td (    server_socket.listen\(5\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 324.5 Td (    print\("TCP Server listening on port 8080..."\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 311.0 Td () Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 297.5 Td (    while True:) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 284.0 Td (        client_sock, client_addr = server_socket.accept\(\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 270.5 Td (        print\(f"Connected to client: {client_addr}"\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 257.0 Td (        data = client_sock.recv\(1024\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 243.5 Td (        if data:) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 230.0 Td (            print\(f"Received: {data.decode\('utf-8'\)}"\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 216.5 Td (            client_sock.sendall\(b"ECHO: " + data\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 203.0 Td (        client_sock.close\(\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 189.5 Td () Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 176.0 Td (if __name__ == '__main__':) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 162.5 Td (    run_tcp_server\(\)) Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 149.0 Td () Tj
b'/F1 8.5 Tf' 40 135.5 Td () Tj
